hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"189","From Nasr bin Marzuq Al-Masry, from Asad, meaning the son of Musa, from Hammad bin Salamah, on the authority of Ayoub, from Abu Qalaba, from Abu Idris Al-Khawlani, on the authority of Bilal, on the authority of the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, “He wiped over those who set their prayers and the veil.”"
